data: {"text":"1. That the applicant above named has been falsely implicated in First Information Report No. 124/2026 dated 15/"}

data: {"text":"03/2026, registered at Police Station Kotwali, under Sections 303 and 351 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023,"}

data: {"text":" and seeks regular bail from this Hon'ble Court being innocent of the charges levelled against him."}

data: {"text":"\n\n2. That the applicant submits that he has been falsely implicated in the aforesaid FIR due to a land dispute with the complainant. The present"}

data: {"text":" case is nothing but a result of malicious prosecution arising out of civil"}

data: {"text":" dispute between the parties over landed property, which the complainant is trying"}

data: {"text":" to convert into a criminal matter to harass and intimidate the applicant.\n\n3. That the"}

data: {"text":" applicant categorically states that he was not present at the time of the alleged incident and has credible witnesses who can vouch for his alibi. The applicant was"}

data: {"text":" elsewhere at the time of the incident and can prove his innocence through documentary evidence and witness testimony that will"}

data: {"text":" establish his presence at a different location during the material time.\n\n4. That the applicant was"}

data: {"text":" arrested on 16/03/2026 and has been languishing in judicial custody since then without any justifiable cause. The continued incarceration of"}

data: {"text":" the applicant serves no purpose as the investigation has been completed and charge sheet has already"}

data: {"text":" been filed.\n\n5. That the applicant has been falsely implicated in the present case due to ulterior motives of the complainant who harb"}

data: {"text":"ours personal grudge against the applicant arising out of the ongoing land dispute. The complain"}

data: {"text":"ant has deliberately misused the process of law to settle"}

data: {"text":" personal scores and has fabricated false allegations against the applicant.\n\n6. That the applicant poses no flight risk whatsoever and"}

data: {"text":" has deep roots in the society. The applicant is a permanent resident of the locality, owns"}

data: {"text":" immovable property, has family ties, and has never absconded from legal proceedings in"}

data: {"text":" the past. There is no apprehension that the applicant will flee from justice if granted"}

data: {"text":" bail.\n\n7. That the applicant has no criminal antecedents and is a law-abiding citizen of good character and reputation"}

data: {"text":" in society. The applicant has never been involved in any criminal activity in the past and the present case is the first of"}

data: {"text":" its kind against him, which itself demonstrates that he has"}

data: {"text":" been falsely implicated.\n\n8. That the applicant undertakes to fully cooperate with the investigation and trial proceedings. The applicant is ready"}

data: {"text":" and willing to comply with any conditions that this Hon'ble Court may deem fit to impose while"}

data: {"text":" granting bail and shall not misuse the liberty granted to him.\n\n9. That the fundamental right to life"}

data: {"text":" and personal liberty as guaranteed under Article 21 of the Constitution of India includes the right to bail, and prolong"}

data: {"text":"ed detention without trial amounts to violation of this constitutional right. The applicant's continued incarceration without reasonable grounds"}

data: {"text":" is contrary to the settled principles of criminal jurisprudence.\n\n10. That the offences"}

data: {"text":" alleged against the applicant are bailable in nature and the prosecution has failed to establish any strong prima facie case against the"}

data: {"text":" applicant. The evidence on record is insufficient to sustain conviction and the applicant is likely to be acquitted at the trial"}

data: {"text":"."}

